  "description": "DOM-free keyboard primitives for .NET and Fable (fickl): W3C KeyboardEvent.code / ISO 9995-1 / USB HID physical keys, W3C KeyboardEvent.key logical keys, ISO 9995-3 dead-key composition, RFC 1345 digraphs, ECMA-48 C0 control codes, Unicode UAX #29 graphemes, and 30-bit packed KeyChord / KeyPress with SIMD acceleration. Use this package alone for modal engines, keymaps, .fsx configs, IPC, SDL/HID input, or tests; add Ranvier.Keyboard.Dom (.NET) or Fable.Ranvier.Keyboard.Dom (browser fickl) when reading Ranvier.Dom.KeyboardEvent.",
